                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Brassworks has a\ntested regulator\nand an operating\nsequence. The",
                                  "inspector takes a\ncopy to Slush.\nRivet sends him\nwith a coat,",
                                  "entered in the\nledger as a loan.\nPip calls this\nunnecessary",
                                  "precision until\nRivet asks whether\nhe wants the coat\nreturned."
                                ],
